	(text "1.     ABSIS TYPE-A CABLE (RS485 BUS CABLE)\n  1.2.   PN: ABSIS-CA-A-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  1.3.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-3065 (5557-06R-BL)\n  1.4.   POWER/GND CONTACTS: 8X 39-00-0211\n  1.5.   DATA CONTACTS: 4X 39-00-0046\n  1.6.   DATA CONDUCTORS A & B: 2X 22AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, TWISTED SHIELDED \n           PAIR (STP), INSULATION COLOR AS DESIRED.\n  1.7.   POWER/GND CONDUCTORS: 4X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  1.8.   MATES WITH: TYPE-E\n2.     ABSIS TYPE-B CABLE (BL BUS CABLE)\n  2.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-B-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  2.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-3045 (5557-04R-BL)\n  2.3.   CONTACTS: 8X 39-00-0211\n  2.4.   CONDUCTORS: 4X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  2.5.   MATES WITH: TYPE-F\n3.     ABSIS TYPE-C CABLE (I/O POWER BUS CABLE)\n  3.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-C-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  3.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-3085 (5557-08R-BL)\n  3.3.   CONTACTS: 16X 39-00-0211\n  3.4.   CONDUCTORS: 8X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  3.5.   MATES WITH: TYPE-G\n4.     ABSIS TYPE-D CABLE (BL POWER BUS CABLE)\n  4.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-D-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  4.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-3105 (5557-10R-BL)\n  4.3.   CONTACTS: 20X 39-00-0211\n  4.4.   CONDUCTORS: 10X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  4.5.   MATES WITH: 39-01-2101 (5559-10P)\n  4.6.   MATING CONTACTS: 10X 39-00-0081\n5.     ABSIS TYPE-E CABLE (RS485 BUS BULKHEAD CABLE)\n  5.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-E-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  5.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-2061 (5559-06P)\n  5.3.   POWER/GND CONTACTS: 8X 39-00-0081\n  5.4.   DATA CONTACTS: 4X 39-00-0048\n  5.5.   DATA CONDUCTORS A & B: 2X 22AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, TWISTED SHIELDED \n           PAIR (STP), INSULATION COLOR AS DESIRED.\n  5.6.   POWER/GND CONDUCTORS: 4X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  5.7.   LENGTH: SHORT, PIGTAIL\n  5.8.   MATES WITH: TYPE-A\n6.     ABSIS TYPE-F CABLE (BL BUS BULKHEAD CABLE)\n  6.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-F-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  6.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-2041 (5559-04P)\n  6.3.   CONTACTS: 8X 39-00-0081\n  6.4.   CONDUCTORS: 4X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  6.5.   MATES WITH: TYPE-B\n7.     ABSIS TYPE-G CABLE (I/O POWER BUS BULKHEAD CABLE)\n  7.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-G-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  7.2.   CONNECTORS: 2X 39-01-2081 (5559-08P)\n  7.2.   CONTACTS: 16X 39-00-0081\n  7.2.   CONDUCTORS: 8X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  7.2.   MATES WITH: TYPE-C\n8.     ABSIS TYPE-H CABLE (I/O ACCESSORY BULKHEAD CABLE)\n  8.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-H-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  8.2.   CONNECTOR 1: 1X 39-01-2221 (5559-22P)\n  8.3.   CONNECTOR 1 CONTACTS: 22X 39-00-0048\n  8.4.   CONNECTOR X: ALL OTHER CONNECTORS PER PRINT.\n  8.5.   CONNECTOR X CONTACTS: PER PRINT.\n  8.6.   CONDUCTORS: 22X 26AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION.\n  8.7.   MATES WITH: 39-01-2220\n  8.8.   MATING CONTACTS: 22X 39-00-0209\n9.     ABSIS TYPE-J CABLE (PWR ACCESSORY CABLE)\n  9.1.   PN: ABSIS-CA-J-XXX (WHERE \"XXX\" IS WIRE LENGTH IN MM)\n  9.2.   CONNECTOR 1: 1X 39-01-3025 (5557-02R-BL)\n  9.3.   CONNECTOR 1 CONTACTS: 2X 39-00-0211\n  9.4.   CONNECTOR X: ALL OTHER CONNECTORS PER PRINT.\n  9.5.   CONNECTOR X CONTACTS: PER PRINT.\n  9.6.   CONDUCTORS: 2X 16AWG STRANDED COPPER CONDUCTORS, WHITE INSULATION."
